 "intent": "Specify the public link-layer header API of etherparse: `Ethernet2Header` (`from_bytes`, `to_bytes`, `write_to_slice`, `header_len`, the constants `LEN` and `SERIALIZED_SIZE`, derived `PartialEq::eq`, `Clone::clone`, `Default::default`), `LinuxSllHeader` (`from_bytes`, `to_bytes`, `write_to_slice`, `header_len`, `LEN`, derived `PartialEq::eq` and `Clone::clone`), and the SLL field types: `LinuxSllPacketType` (`TryFrom<u16>`, its constants, `From<LinuxSllPacketType> for u16`), `LinuxNonstandardEtherType` (`TryFrom<u16>`, its constants, `From<LinuxNonstandardEtherType> for u16`), `LinuxSllProtocolType` (`TryFrom<(ArpHardwareId, u16)>`, `From<LinuxSllProtocolType> for u16`, derived `PartialEq::eq`), and the `ArpHardwareId`/`EtherType` `u16` conversions.",
 "manual_mutants": [
